"<code>output.site_eui &lt; s.target_eui</code>."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Use <strong>Sample Data</strong> on the right to paste real submission JSON "
"or XML. Validibot will detect available paths you can map."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Signal names must be valid identifiers: letters, numbers, and underscores "
"only, starting with a letter or underscore."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For arrays of named objects, use a filter expression in the data path: "
"<code>items[?@.name=='emissivity'].value</code>."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Set <strong>On missing</strong> to control what happens when a path can't be "
"resolved: <em>Error</em> stops the run, <em>Null</em> injects null (guard "
"with <code>s.name != null</code> in CEL)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Signals are resolved <strong>once</strong> at the start of a validation run "
"and stay consistent across all steps."
